      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TATAMAGOUCHE (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 17.71 beating Saint Kylie. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Sure to prove hard to beat. LEKTRA LYANNA (2) turned in a moderate performance last time when eighth at Warrnambool over 390m behind Electrojet (22.60) in a Grade 4/5. Form from her last run is proving strong. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. COMPTON BOWIE (8) jumped from this box and placed in a Other at this track over 305m last time, finishing 3.5 lengths from the winner (18.05). Has a strong record off this same draw including two wins. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. SAINT ELLA (6) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
